Author: Augustus Greenwood <abg@unandup.com>
Maintainer: Augustus Greenwood <abg@unandup.com>
Title: 96-Well Plate Assay Data Analysis
Description: Tools for loading, processing, and plotting 96-well plate
 absorbance assay data. Currently supports iron (Fe/Fe3O4) quantification
 via a standards-curve workflow; structured to add other plate-based
 assays and plotting utilities over time.
Depends: octave (>= 11.0.0), io (>= 2.6.0)
License: GPLv3
